OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 10 DEC
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GHalf an hour of classical music,
OL,6,     Gincluding some festive favourites
OL,7,     Gby Rutter, Britten and Lauridsen.
OL,8,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,9,     GKazuki Yamada conducts the City
OL,10,     Gof Birmingham Symphony Orchestra
OL,11,     Gin an all-Strauss programme,
OL,12,     Gincluding Also Sprach
OL,13,     GZarathustra, a piece with one of
OL,14,     Gmusic's most iconic openings.
OL,15,G2145FThe Essay: Scotland in Song
OL,16,     GMusic knows many different forms
OL,17,     Gin Scotland, as a result of her
OL,18,     Gradically different traditions.
OL,19,     GPoet Kenneth Steven chooses to
OL,20,     Gexplore the stories of five
OL,21,     Gcomposers.
